 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nSuministros del Norte SL                                  MASTER SERVICES\nAvenida Diagonal 220, 08001 Barcelona, Spain              AGREEMENT\nCIF/NIF: ESB79754598\nReg No: ES-470622\n\nFROM                                                     FACTURAR A\n\nSuministros del Norte SL                                 Suministros del Norte SL\nAvenida Diagonal 220                                     Avenida Diagonal 220\n08001 Barcelona                                          46001 Valencia\nSpain                                                    Spain\nVAT: ESB79754598\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 28/02/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and\nbetween Suministros del Norte SL, with its registered office at Avenida Diagonal 220, Barcelona (\"Party A\"), and\nSuministros del Norte SL, with its registered office at Avenida Diagonal 220, Valencia (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in\naccordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the\npurposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Suministros del Norte SL / Lucía Fernández\nParty B      Suministros del Norte SL / Lucía Fernández\nDate         28/02/2026",
